<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="/images/logo.jpg">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Shipping Policy - New Heels</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { background: #F8F3EF; }
        .page-header { padding: 60px 0 30px; text-align: center; }
        .page-header h1 { color: #3F3040; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .page-header p { color: #8B6688; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .policy-card { background: white; padding: 50px; border-top: 4px solid #C9A45C; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 60px; box-shadow: 0 5px 30px rgba(63, 48, 64, 0.05); }
        .policy-card h3 { color: #3F3040; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px; padding-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #F8F3EF; }
        .policy-card h3:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
        .policy-card p, .policy-card li { color: #5a4a5c; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .policy-card ul { padding-left: 20px; }
        .policy-card strong { color: #8B6688; }
        .highlight-box { background: #F8F3EF; padding: 20px; border-left: 4px solid #C9A45C; margin: 20px 0; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .policy-card { padding: 30px 20px; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <div class="page-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
            <p>Delivery Information & Timelines</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="policy-card">
            <h3>Delivery Areas</h3>
            <p>We deliver to all major cities across Pakistan including Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Multan, Peshawar, Quetta, and more.</p>

            <h3>Delivery Time</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Karachi:</strong> 1-2 business days</li>
                <li><strong>Major Cities:</strong> 2-3 business days</li>
                <li><strong>Other Areas:</strong> 3-5 business days</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>Shipping Charges</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> On all orders above Rs. 4,000</li>
                <li><strong>Standard Delivery:</strong> Rs. 250 for orders below Rs. 4,000</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="highlight-box">
                <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>💵 Cash on Delivery:</strong> Available on all orders. Pay only when you receive your order.</p>
            </div>

            <h3>Order Tracking</h3>
            <p>Once your order is placed, you can track its status anytime on our <a href="/track-order" style="color: #8B6688; text-decoration: underline;">Track Order</a> page.</p>

            <h3>Packaging</h3>
            <p>All orders are carefully packed to ensure your products arrive in perfect condition.</p>

            <h3>Contact Us</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> newheelsmardan@gmail.com</li>
                <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> 0327 7985292</li>
                <li><strong>Hours:</strong> Mon-Sat, 10 AM - 10 PM</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>